/P 116 0 R
/E (Students can be dropped off on the school playground as early as 7:35am, where several school supervisors monitor daily. Teachers arrive on the playground to lead their classes inside at the first bell \(7:50am\). Classroom instruction begins at 7:55am. Your teacher will send specific directions on where to line up in their welcome emails. The older grades \(3-5\) typically walk in by themselves. The playground gates are locked around 8:15am. If you arrive after classroom instruction begins, you will need to go in through the office and sign your child in.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [15]
>>
