705 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (Adams Elementary strives for equality, and as such the PTA provides school supplies for each child, in each classroom. At the start of school, you will be provided with a paypal link to donate to the PTA to cover the cost of the school supplies for your child\(ren\), as well as others who may not be able to afford it. Traditionally, the cost is around $30 per child. The PTA also provides classroom funds to each teacher for room enhancements.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
