<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Adams has a balanced, integrated arts program encompassing theater, visual, dance, and musical arts. Our award-winning program is the only one of its kind in the district. Art is infused into daily instruction; every student receives a sketchbook and spends at least ten minutes in daily drawing. This teaches students how to visually problem-solve. Most every teacher has received two years of training with Arts Impact, and all participate in ongoing arts training. At the national level, it is recognized that when the arts are included in the classroom, learning increases at every level.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [8]
>>
