754 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Adams features the Resource Room and the Focus Room. The Resource Room is for students with special needs \(reading, math, writing, social/behavior, adaptive/life skills, and study organization\) who are fully included in general education. Adams has Occupational Therapy, Physical Therapy, and Speech and Language Therapy services on-site. Students can be recommended for the Resource Room via an existing IEP \(Individualized Education Plan\) or by their teacher. Adams also offers tutoring services, as needed and determined by the classroom teacher. The self-contained special education room is known as the Focus Room, and operates outside of the general education environment. If you would like your child evaluated for any of these services, please speak with their homeroom classroom teacher.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
